          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waan nami akana daalleefi, Waaqi ya worra lakise, aka waan hamtu ka garaani worraa d'araufi tolchani waan ch'eera woli tolchani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "D'uga Waaqaa lakisani waan d'ara tolchani, Waaqa ka waan ch'ufa uume lakisani, waan inni uume kad'atani ulfeesani. Inni haga hegeri ha guddifamu! Amini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maro waan nami tolchuufi, Waaqi ya waan hamtu ka ch'eera worrati lakise. Nad'eeni ya aada ufi ta rifane lakifte waan aada male taate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "D'iirtileeni ya nad'eeni lakifte wolid'araate. D'iirti waan ch'eera woltolchite, akanaani gaargala argachu malte nafa ufi keesa argatti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maro biyyiti waan d'uga Waaqa barachu diddeefi, inni ya qalbi hamtuti worra lakise, tanaafi waan tolchu himmalini tolchani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ya hameennafi ch'ubbufi sabdoomafi t'uriini guutamani; wolqot'isani, wolijeesani, wolhad'ani, wolsobani, wolhamatani. Duddaduuba wolnyaatani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hameenna woli dubbatani; Waaqa jibbani, kiyyibaani, ufi saadani, ufi guddisani; kara heddu ka hameennaani tolchani heregani; worra ufiti insaalfatani; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hameenna gula yaani, kakhu ufi injabeesani, nama d'ibi inahani yokhaani iyaalani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri aka Waaqi nami waan kana gula yau duaa male jed'u imbeekha. Ammo taatule waan kana tolchu illakisani, ammalle nama waan kana tolchule wolti quufani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Qorsuma Waaqa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
